00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:21.030
I was interested in being
entrepreneur, what's up Jay Z?

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:22.650
You know what I'm saying?

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:23.483
So, you know,

00:05:23.483 --> 00:05:25.650
